WEBVTT

00:00.610 --> 00:02.670
Let go! Let go of me, Go!

00:04.650 --> 00:07.350
Damn you! Don't let go of me so quickly!

00:07.350 --> 00:09.320
Complaining about letting you go and not letting you go...

00:09.320 --> 00:10.320
You're such a loudmouth.

00:10.320 --> 00:12.260
Why aren't we allowed to listen, anyway?!

00:12.260 --> 00:13.560
Well, that's...

00:13.560 --> 00:16.800
I know! We'd better find the demon larva that got away.

00:16.800 --> 00:18.000
Don't change the subject!

00:18.000 --> 00:20.800
Hayate's going to talk about something important to Himeno, isn't he?

00:20.800 --> 00:22.730
We're Leafe Knights too!

00:26.070 --> 00:27.940
I wonder if this is the right thing after all?

00:28.610 --> 00:30.710
All this time, I wanted to know.

00:30.710 --> 00:33.580
But I'm scared, because...

00:33.580 --> 00:34.550
This is it.

00:35.080 --> 00:37.320
Even Hayate is...

00:37.320 --> 00:39.720
This is where it all began.

00:39.720 --> 00:42.880
It's the place where the sin that I committed sleeps.

00:50.860 --> 00:52.860
Her name is Takako.

00:52.860 --> 00:55.630
She was the Prétear.

00:55.630 --> 00:58.070
Until sixteen years ago, on that day...

00:58.680 --> 01:01.950
The boundless future stretches across the skies

00:58.680 --> 01:01.950
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:01.950 --> 01:05.990
And I am reborn anew

01:01.950 --> 01:05.990
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

01:05.990 --> 01:13.010
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

01:05.990 --> 01:13.010
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

01:17.190 --> 01:17.390
Prétear

01:25.240 --> 01:32.150
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

01:25.240 --> 01:32.150
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

01:32.150 --> 01:36.940
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

01:32.150 --> 01:36.940
kimerareta ashita wa nai

01:38.990 --> 01:45.890
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

01:38.990 --> 01:45.890
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

01:45.890 --> 01:50.800
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

01:45.890 --> 01:50.800
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

01:52.630 --> 01:56.500
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

01:52.630 --> 01:56.500
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

01:56.500 --> 01:59.640
If the cold wind glimmers

01:56.500 --> 01:59.640
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

01:59.640 --> 02:05.410
I can hear your voice drifting gently

01:59.640 --> 02:05.410
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

02:05.580 --> 02:05.880
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

02:05.580 --> 02:10.350
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

02:10.350 --> 02:12.890
Warms it so much that it hurts

02:10.350 --> 02:12.890
kono mune o atsuku suru

02:12.890 --> 02:15.620
It all begins from the point of believing

02:12.890 --> 02:15.620
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

02:15.620 --> 02:19.290
These feelings are proof of being alive

02:15.620 --> 02:19.290
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

02:19.290 --> 02:19.590
The endless future and the expanding skies

02:19.290 --> 02:22.500
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

02:22.500 --> 02:26.530
Allow me to be reborn anew

02:22.500 --> 02:26.530
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

02:26.530 --> 02:32.640
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

02:26.530 --> 02:32.640
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:32.640 --> 02:37.240
Holding hands with you

02:32.640 --> 02:39.240
sono te tsunaide

02:39.500 --> 02:42.870
Can't Protect Anyone Anymore

02:44.480 --> 02:49.410
At that time, we needed the Prétear's strength.

02:50.820 --> 02:51.870
And...

02:53.550 --> 02:55.210
The chosen one was...

02:56.020 --> 02:57.280
Takako.

03:01.960 --> 03:07.630
She had incredible potential as the Prétear, but...

03:12.170 --> 03:16.170
While she was fighting the enemy, she was fighting herself.

03:16.170 --> 03:18.210
Or it appeared that way.

03:18.210 --> 03:22.340
An enemy known as fear, residing in her heart.

03:24.080 --> 03:29.620
As a Leafe Knight, I greatly appreciated her deep emotions,

03:29.620 --> 03:34.390
...but thinking back, that was what started the disaster in the first place.

03:35.160 --> 03:37.330
Then, she changed.

03:37.330 --> 03:44.030
Her confusion disappeared in combat, and her abilities as the Prétear grew at an incredible pace.

03:47.370 --> 03:48.740
Takako, she...

03:54.180 --> 03:57.670
On the day the world achieved peace, thanks to her...

04:18.940 --> 04:20.200
Takako was...

04:37.720 --> 04:39.820
I fought for you!

04:39.820 --> 04:42.760
I endured the pain and the fear, but even then...

04:42.760 --> 04:45.460
Takako, I appreciate what you've done.

04:45.460 --> 04:47.470
That's not what I want!

04:47.470 --> 04:50.700
I want YOU, Hayate!

04:59.810 --> 05:01.440
Takako, she...

05:01.980 --> 05:03.080
Hayate...

05:03.080 --> 05:07.480
That's right, Takako loved Hayate.

05:09.390 --> 05:13.790
But I wasn't able to reciprocate her feelings.

05:17.360 --> 05:19.090
Then, on that day...

05:35.610 --> 05:36.840
I don't want it.

05:50.230 --> 05:52.320
I don't want a world like this!

05:54.330 --> 05:55.200
Takako!

05:57.570 --> 05:59.000
Begone...

06:24.160 --> 06:29.630
The dark side of her heart caused the direction of her powers to go haywire.

06:29.630 --> 06:32.740
Without the Prétear, our battles were downright wretched.

06:32.740 --> 06:35.570
In order to seal away Takako, who became the Princess of Disaster,

06:36.410 --> 06:38.480
...we suffered tremendous casualties.

06:38.480 --> 06:40.110
Casualties?

06:40.110 --> 06:44.920
In order to seal her, a great amount of energy was needed.

06:44.920 --> 06:49.420
In order to do that, three Knights used up their energy and faded.

06:49.420 --> 06:50.990
Faded?!

06:50.990 --> 06:53.220
Leafe is the power of life.

06:53.220 --> 06:58.720
If we lose all of it, we Knights can no longer maintain our bodies.

06:59.460 --> 07:02.730
She was the Prétear, but she will destroy the world?

07:02.730 --> 07:06.760
She was the Prétear, but she fights against the Knights, and...

07:07.310 --> 07:09.970
No, I don't want that!

07:09.970 --> 07:11.780
Maybe I too will...

07:11.780 --> 07:12.810
Himeno...

07:12.810 --> 07:14.880
The possibility isn't zero.

07:14.880 --> 07:15.980
Kei!

07:15.980 --> 07:18.720
The difference between a Prétear and the Princess of Disaster...

07:18.720 --> 07:21.520
...is whether one takes or gives. It's either a plus or a minus.

07:21.520 --> 07:22.720
Stop it, Kei!

07:22.720 --> 07:25.060
If you change the direction of your powers toward the negative side,

07:25.060 --> 07:27.060
...then you'll become a more powerful Princess of Disaster.

07:27.060 --> 07:27.830
Kei!

07:27.830 --> 07:31.130
But that's only if you let negative energy carry you away.

07:31.130 --> 07:32.130
That's right!

07:32.130 --> 07:33.830
That's not something you should be concerned with, Himeno!

07:33.830 --> 07:36.700
You mean you told Mannen and the others about this?!

07:37.640 --> 07:38.770
Why did you...

07:38.770 --> 07:42.240
There's no merit in hiding the truth.

07:42.240 --> 07:44.280
That's what I realized.

07:44.280 --> 07:48.110
By hiding the truth about Takako, what happened to Himeno?

07:48.110 --> 07:51.120
Her heart was distracted and fighting wasn't a priority.

07:51.120 --> 07:55.420
That's right! It was as though you were lying to her!

07:55.420 --> 07:56.520
That's different.

07:56.520 --> 07:57.660
No, it's not!

07:57.660 --> 07:58.460
Mannen...

07:58.460 --> 07:59.820
Yo, Hayate!

07:59.820 --> 08:03.820
Is it true it's your fault a Prétear became the Princess of Disaster?!

08:05.330 --> 08:08.200
Then it's not right to have Himeno fight!

08:09.130 --> 08:10.540
Mannen, what are you...

08:10.540 --> 08:12.840
This is why children shouldn't...

08:12.840 --> 08:16.810
You can say things like that because you don't know the real horror behind the Princess of Disaster.

08:17.040 --> 08:21.280
Without the Prétear, it's impossible to defeat the Princess of Disaster.

08:21.280 --> 08:24.840
Himeno is indispensable to us.

08:26.820 --> 08:30.120
But this battle has nothing to do with her!

08:30.120 --> 08:31.190
Yeah!

08:31.190 --> 08:33.520
Poor Himeno!

08:33.520 --> 08:34.860
Nothing to do with...

08:43.570 --> 08:46.670
If the Princess of Disaster wasn't born, Himeno wouldn't have...

08:46.670 --> 08:48.570
He's right.

08:49.510 --> 08:53.410
I'm the reason for the Princess of Disaster, for Takako.

08:53.410 --> 08:57.070
You'd better not be thinking about handling this all by yourself!

08:58.120 --> 08:59.620
This isn't a joke!

08:59.620 --> 09:01.890
If she were an opponent you could beat by yourself,

09:01.890 --> 09:04.480
...we wouldn't have dragged Himeno into this in the first place!

09:05.320 --> 09:07.880
I was dragged in?

09:08.890 --> 09:10.430
What should I do?

09:10.430 --> 09:13.330
What do I need to do to become the Prétear?

09:13.330 --> 09:14.990
Say something, Hayate!

09:15.630 --> 09:16.690
Go, no!

09:17.640 --> 09:20.140
This isn't your problem alone!

09:20.140 --> 09:20.770
Go!

09:20.770 --> 09:22.240
Stop it!

09:23.740 --> 09:26.140
Let go, Sasame! This guy's always...

09:26.140 --> 09:26.740
Go!

09:26.740 --> 09:28.450
You always act like this yourself.

09:28.450 --> 09:30.350
Stop!

09:31.820 --> 09:32.650
Me too?!

09:33.220 --> 09:35.220
You're all damned depressing!

09:35.220 --> 09:38.390
Boys shouldn't be making such a big fuss over this!

09:38.390 --> 09:41.830
You're all Leafe Knights! Calm down a little!

09:41.830 --> 09:44.630
You're causing me a lot of problems getting carried away like this!

09:44.630 --> 09:46.930
I'm one of you!

09:46.930 --> 09:51.270
Not once have I thought I got dragged into this nor have I thought this is none of my business!

09:51.270 --> 09:53.840
You sure about this, Himeno?

09:53.840 --> 09:56.140
I'll be all right.

09:56.140 --> 09:59.130
Besides, I think it's a lot more painful not to say anything.

10:00.610 --> 10:01.910
Instead of concentrating on me,

10:01.910 --> 10:05.720
...I think it's more important to get everyone on the same page.

10:05.720 --> 10:09.240
If we're not on the same page, then we can't combine our powers.

10:10.420 --> 10:11.420
What is it?

10:11.420 --> 10:16.830
Well, you're saying something that makes perfect sense, so we're a little surprised.

10:16.830 --> 10:18.900
It's as though you're a Prétear.

10:18.900 --> 10:20.450
I AM a Prétear!

10:21.730 --> 10:23.330
So you're finally laughing.

10:23.940 --> 10:27.200
All right! Now that we're all friends again, I'm buying ice cream!

10:27.840 --> 10:30.710
I'll give you lots of powdered green tea kimchee and chocolate chip!

10:34.280 --> 10:35.400
Wait, Hayate.

10:40.020 --> 10:43.090
Hayate, thanks for sharing that story.

10:43.090 --> 10:49.090
Now I have the feeling that I truly am one of your comrades in arms.

10:49.090 --> 10:50.630
Himeno...

10:50.630 --> 10:52.430
Let's do our best.

10:52.430 --> 10:54.800
Together, always.

10:58.640 --> 10:59.870
That guy, again!

10:59.870 --> 11:03.640
No problem! He won't say he'll fight alone ever again!

11:03.640 --> 11:05.610
Now let's go get some ice cream!

11:07.650 --> 11:08.630
See ya!

11:09.350 --> 11:11.350
See you later!

11:11.350 --> 11:15.390
"Strength, thy name is woman," or so it is said.

11:15.390 --> 11:16.620
What is that?

11:16.620 --> 11:20.690
It means Himeno's a much tougher girl than we had thought.

11:20.690 --> 11:22.830
Yeah, yeah, it's just as Kei says.

11:22.830 --> 11:25.230
Do you even understand what those words mean?

11:25.230 --> 11:28.730
Sure I do. It means there's no need to worry about Himeno, right?

11:28.730 --> 11:30.500
I wonder if that's really the case?

11:31.540 --> 11:32.770
Sasame?

11:32.770 --> 11:36.840
A wound in the heart doesn't heal easily.

11:36.840 --> 11:42.140
The open wound never closes, nor does the pain go away.

11:57.830 --> 11:59.300
I have to do my best.

12:00.730 --> 12:02.490
For everyone's sake...

12:18.480 --> 12:21.080
Jeez! She's so noisy!

12:26.920 --> 12:28.630
She knows nothing.

12:28.630 --> 12:30.500
Tanaka, put the roofing tile on top of that thing.

12:30.500 --> 12:33.690
But this tile is extremely heavy.

12:34.830 --> 12:36.030
Of course it is.

12:36.030 --> 12:39.070
Our Awayuki Heavy Industries developed this tile.

12:39.070 --> 12:42.040
It has a special 10mm super steel alloy inside it.

12:42.040 --> 12:44.280
Not to mention its weight, but it's so hard and sturdy,

12:44.280 --> 12:46.540
...an elephant can step on it and it won't break.

12:46.540 --> 12:48.100
Himeno, not knowing anything, will...

12:51.380 --> 12:53.940
It's dangerous out here, Mr. Tanaka.

12:56.420 --> 12:59.860
Ow! It hurts a lot more than hitting my pinky on the corner of an expensive drawer!

13:03.730 --> 13:06.130
Oh, yeah. It's almost breakfast.

13:06.130 --> 13:08.270
I wonder what today's side dishes are?

13:08.270 --> 13:10.430
Is she stupid?

13:28.320 --> 13:32.620
We'd better find that demon larva that escaped and settle things.

13:32.620 --> 13:34.390
But how do we look for it?

13:34.390 --> 13:36.130
It can mask its presence, right?

13:36.130 --> 13:38.030
Well...

13:38.030 --> 13:41.530
At a time like this, we go back to basics and search on foot!

13:41.530 --> 13:43.700
You just don't have a plan.

13:43.700 --> 13:47.400
That goes against my aesthetics, but that seems to be the only option available.

13:47.940 --> 13:48.910
Where's Hayate?

13:49.640 --> 13:52.740
He's working, so he's playing her guard now.

13:52.740 --> 13:53.730
I see.

13:54.180 --> 13:55.350
Something the matter?

13:55.350 --> 13:56.550
Well, no...

13:56.550 --> 13:58.450
All right, I'm off to search.

14:01.490 --> 14:02.650
I'm finished.

14:03.190 --> 14:06.490
Wait, time out! Mawata, you're not finishing that?

14:06.490 --> 14:07.120
That's right.

14:07.120 --> 14:09.730
What a waste. Can I have it?

14:09.730 --> 14:10.390
Feel free.

14:10.390 --> 14:11.830
Lucky!

14:11.830 --> 14:14.390
After exercising, I really get hungry!

14:15.130 --> 14:17.540
At this age, I really pay for pushing myself.

14:17.540 --> 14:20.640
But becoming so involved with the statue and staying up all night...

14:20.640 --> 14:22.440
...is like being a young man! That's so wonderful!

14:22.440 --> 14:26.100
Dad, Mother! Good morning!

14:28.850 --> 14:29.450
What?

14:29.450 --> 14:30.810
Himeno!

14:31.580 --> 14:32.850
Miss Himeno!

14:32.850 --> 14:34.550
Natsue...

14:34.550 --> 14:38.690
Now that you've become a daughter of this household, be more aware of your appearance!

14:38.690 --> 14:40.160
As a daughter of the Awayuki family,

14:40.160 --> 14:42.530
...it is shameful to walk around with a roofing tile on your head.

14:42.530 --> 14:44.630
Even a girl from a normal family wouldn't do that though.

14:44.630 --> 14:45.890
I'll clean this up.

14:46.430 --> 14:50.640
I'm sorry, Mikage. I slipped up, so to speak.

14:50.640 --> 14:51.640
Please don't jest.

14:51.640 --> 14:53.600
While I'm at it, please pardon me for this too.

14:56.740 --> 14:57.710
See you!

15:02.580 --> 15:03.550
Himeno!

15:05.080 --> 15:06.250
Are you all right?

15:06.250 --> 15:07.280
With what?

15:07.280 --> 15:08.250
My butt?

15:09.020 --> 15:10.620
It's cracked in two!

15:10.620 --> 15:11.850
Just kidding.

15:14.890 --> 15:17.090
Hayate, you're being too gloomy.

15:17.090 --> 15:19.630
You have to constantly look forward! See you!

15:19.630 --> 15:21.600
Today, I'm going race the limousine!

15:25.240 --> 15:28.440
I wish Miss Himeno would ride with us once in a while.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.870
Leave her be.

15:29.870 --> 15:32.810
Commoners should run like commoners and she can be late if she...

15:33.440 --> 15:34.310
Himeno?!

15:40.480 --> 15:41.680
Serves her right.

15:46.420 --> 15:47.830
Looks like she's suffering.

15:47.830 --> 15:49.090
Kei! There!

15:50.930 --> 15:52.630
Damn, a shameless frontal assault.

15:52.630 --> 15:54.660
Hajime, report this to everyone!

16:04.240 --> 16:05.940
Oh, this is great!

16:05.940 --> 16:07.980
In this part, the main character's former boyfriend,

16:07.980 --> 16:10.050
...who's a female-style romance novelist, BOOM, comes in,

16:10.050 --> 16:12.450
...immediately after she was proposed to by her current boyfriend!

16:12.450 --> 16:14.650
From there, it's just as good as if I already read it!

16:14.650 --> 16:18.260
The main character's former boyfriend and the French fiancé Madros fight over the heroine...

16:18.260 --> 16:22.390
...by selling egg custard in the middle of the night in a one-round, winner-takes-all match!

16:22.390 --> 16:25.300
In the end, a young man riding a dolphin sweeps her off her feet...

16:25.300 --> 16:27.030
...and the two of them run away to the ocean!

16:27.030 --> 16:28.930
Oh, how romantic!

16:28.930 --> 16:29.870
Himeno?

16:34.110 --> 16:35.840
Seems like it's around here somewhere.

16:35.840 --> 16:38.140
Damn it, where is it hiding?

16:41.280 --> 16:42.250
There you are!

16:44.150 --> 16:45.010
Let's go underground!

16:47.850 --> 16:49.320
See you, Himeno.

16:49.950 --> 16:51.480
The cram school is over here, so...

16:52.890 --> 16:53.790
See you!

17:01.330 --> 17:02.700
All right!

17:02.700 --> 17:04.540
Feel good, feel good!

17:04.540 --> 17:06.440
Look forward! Look forward!

17:06.440 --> 17:08.060
Good, good!

17:15.580 --> 17:16.940
Good...

17:28.830 --> 17:31.300
A demon larva is close by! Shin, let everyone...

17:31.300 --> 17:32.060
Sure!

17:42.540 --> 17:43.800
This place is...

17:44.340 --> 17:47.040
Why am I here?

17:47.040 --> 17:51.850
The difference between a Prétear and the Princess of Disaster is whether one takes or gives.

17:51.850 --> 17:54.350
If you change the direction of your powers toward the negative side,

17:54.350 --> 17:56.250
...then you'll become a more powerful Princess of Disaster.

17:56.250 --> 17:58.620
She was the Prétear, but she fights against the Knights.

17:59.590 --> 18:02.320
She was the Prétear, but she will destroy the world.

18:05.430 --> 18:07.030
Because she was the Prétear...

18:07.030 --> 18:09.500
In order to seal away Takako, who became the Princess of Disaster,

18:10.230 --> 18:12.170
...we suffered tremendous casualties.

18:12.170 --> 18:15.840
In order to do that, three Knights used up their energy and faded.

18:15.840 --> 18:17.640
Leafe is the power of life.

18:17.640 --> 18:22.150
If we lose all of it, we Knights can no longer maintain our bodies.

18:22.150 --> 18:26.350
Without the Prétear, it's impossible to defeat the Princess of Disaster.

18:26.350 --> 18:29.490
No! I shouldn't think of such things!

18:29.490 --> 18:30.450
Himeno?

18:31.060 --> 18:33.460
You sensed the presence of a demon larva as well?

18:37.730 --> 18:38.490
What the?!

18:39.200 --> 18:40.490
Himeno!

18:43.600 --> 18:44.500
Hayate!

18:50.610 --> 18:52.010
I've been waiting.

18:54.450 --> 18:55.210
What?

18:59.380 --> 19:00.550
What's the meaning of this?!

19:00.550 --> 19:01.420
Kei!

19:05.220 --> 19:06.620
That thing didn't have a core!

19:06.620 --> 19:07.780
A husk?!

19:08.630 --> 19:10.530
It's awful! The demon larva are...

19:10.530 --> 19:11.860
Damn it! A decoy!

19:12.930 --> 19:13.930
Himeno...

19:13.930 --> 19:14.930
Don't listen.

19:14.930 --> 19:17.400
There's no need to listen to the words of the Princess of Disaster!

19:17.400 --> 19:19.240
You're so cold, Hayate.

19:19.240 --> 19:21.340
If you were like that in the first place,

19:21.340 --> 19:24.070
...it might have ended without me falling in love with you.

19:25.640 --> 19:27.240
Say, Himeno.

19:27.240 --> 19:29.840
Please tell me about Hayate.

19:30.580 --> 19:33.750
Is he kind to you too?

19:33.750 --> 19:37.450
Or does he act very coldly toward you?

19:37.450 --> 19:40.960
The Hayate I knew was very kind.

19:40.960 --> 19:44.420
The smile he'd show once in a while was absolutely radiant.

19:48.200 --> 19:50.000
I remember it even now!

19:50.000 --> 19:51.090
Hayate!

19:51.700 --> 19:52.790
Let's prét!

20:07.790 --> 20:09.620
We can't prét? Why?!

20:11.560 --> 20:14.860
That's because, Himeno, you learned the truth.

20:14.860 --> 20:16.930
The human heart is very brittle.

20:16.930 --> 20:19.300
No matter how much you want to fool yourself,

20:19.300 --> 20:23.700
...the wounds in your heart will keep bleeding sorrow.

20:23.700 --> 20:25.940
Be honest with yourself.

20:25.940 --> 20:27.600
It's really painful, isn't it?

20:27.600 --> 20:29.610
You're scared to death, aren't you?

20:29.610 --> 20:31.940
Thanks to the Knights that you believed in,

20:31.940 --> 20:34.750
...you've been sucked into the whirlpool of terror.

20:34.750 --> 20:36.950
You were being used.

20:36.950 --> 20:39.180
Now you can't believe in anything.

20:39.180 --> 20:40.650
You can't believe in anything!

20:40.650 --> 20:41.450
No!

20:41.450 --> 20:42.250
Himeno!

20:42.250 --> 20:43.410
No way!

20:44.250 --> 20:47.260
I'm not wounded!

20:47.260 --> 20:51.350
But if I lose, then I can't protect anyone!

20:52.530 --> 20:54.300
That's why, I...

20:54.300 --> 20:56.000
Himeno, that's enough!

20:56.000 --> 20:56.930
I...

20:56.930 --> 20:58.300
You don't have to anymore.

21:00.340 --> 21:03.840
Himeno, you'll never be the Prétear again!

21:03.840 --> 21:05.740
Even if you want to be so in your heart,

21:05.740 --> 21:08.440
...deep within your heart, you don't want to fight!

21:08.980 --> 21:09.950
Stop it!

21:09.950 --> 21:14.540
Now, Princess of Sorrow, feel the wrath of darkness!

21:15.850 --> 21:19.410
Please stop, Takako!

21:23.190 --> 21:28.890
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.190 --> 21:28.890
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:28.890 --> 21:33.130
The stars shine in the night sky

21:28.890 --> 21:33.130
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.130 --> 21:39.000
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.130 --> 21:39.000
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.000 --> 21:41.870
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.000 --> 21:41.870
katte na jinkusu

21:41.870 --> 21:47.850
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:41.870 --> 21:47.850
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:47.850 --> 21:51.820
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:47.850 --> 21:51.820
ashita wa egao de

21:51.820 --> 21:57.920
I'll greet you good morning

21:51.820 --> 21:57.920
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:57.920 --> 22:02.230
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:57.920 --> 22:02.230
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.230 --> 22:03.590
My Sweet Heart

22:02.230 --> 22:03.590
My Sweet Heart

22:03.590 --> 22:09.900
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.590 --> 22:09.900
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:09.900 --> 22:13.670
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:09.900 --> 22:13.670
arienai yurusenai

22:13.670 --> 22:20.680
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.670 --> 22:20.680
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.680 --> 22:29.020
To do it secretly, without you knowing

22:20.680 --> 22:29.020
kizukarenai you ni naisho de

22:41.640 --> 22:44.140
Why am I such a good for nothing?!

22:44.140 --> 22:46.510
So even you get depressed like this.

22:46.510 --> 22:50.010
I definitely don't want to be beaten, but...

22:47.440 --> 22:50.310
Moment of Awakening
